sequenceDiagram
  actor Faculty
  participant UI as Streamlit
  participant Service as Application services
  participant Rules as Analytics engine
  participant DB as SQLite
  Faculty->>UI: Select subject and assessment period
  UI->>Service: Request class summary
  Service->>DB: Read records after authorization
  DB-->>Service: Academic records
  Service->>Rules: Aggregate periods, compute scores and trends
  Rules-->>Service: Intervention status with reasons
  Service-->>UI: Class summary
  UI-->>Faculty: Metrics, charts and flags
